cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, the model checkpoints or the reproduction materials, please cite the paper below."
title: "Sub-daily FRP forecasting over Mediterranean wildfires: reproduction package"
abstract: >-
  Code, pre-registration, model checkpoints and per-event results for a study of
  sub-daily Fire Radiative Power forecasting over Mediterranean wildfires, driven
  by MSG-SEVIRI FRP and ERA5 covariates. A persistence-residual neural forecaster
  is compared against log-space gradient boosting under a registration committed
  before the single evaluation of a sequestered 46-fire test block, followed by a
  labelled exploratory replication on 32 fires of the next season and on six
  alternative encoders. The pre-registered primary test does not reject.
